 "_readme": [
  "USER video-model registry \u2014 merged into tool/video_models.py:VIDEO_MODELS at",
  "load time. Add your optimized/distinct models here WITHOUT touching code.",
  "",
  "Each entry follows the exact VIDEO_MODELS schema (see wan22_5b_q4 in",
  "video_models.py for a full example). Minimum viable entry for a GGUF Wan",
  "family model that reuses an existing workflow template:",
  "",
  "  \"my_model_id\": {",
  "    \"id\": \"my_model_id\",",
  "    \"display_name\": \"My Optimized Quant\",",
  "    \"family\": \"wan22_ti2v_5b\",",
  "    \"version\": \"2.2\",",
  "    \"path\": \"models/diffusion_models/MyOptimized-Q6_K.gguf\",",
  "    \"format\": \"gguf\",",
  "    \"quantization\": \"Q6_K\",",
  "    \"workflow\": \"wan2.2_ti2v_5b\",",
  "    \"workflow_version\": 1,",
  "    \"text_encoder\": \"models/text_encoders/umt5-xxl-encoder-Q4_K_M.gguf\",",
  "    \"vae\": \"models/vae/wan2.2_vae.safetensors\",",
  "    \"supported_modes\": [\"t2v\", \"i2v\"],",
  "    \"supported_loras\": [\"wan22_5b\"],",
  "    \"supported_controls\": [\"prompt\", \"negative\", \"seed\", \"resolution\", \"frames\", \"steps\", \"sampler\", \"cfg\", \"loras\", \"start_image\", \"cache\"],",
  "    \"defaults\": {\"steps\": 8, \"cfg\": 1.0},",
  "    \"resolution_limits\": {\"min\": [256, 256], \"max\": [1280, 720], \"step\": 16, \"native\": [\"832x480\"]},",
  "    \"frame_limits\": {\"min\": 5, \"max\": 121, \"step\": 4},",
  "    \"vram_estimate_mb\": 7000,",
  "    \"experimental\": true,",
  "    \"source\": \"my-optimization\",",
  "    \"note\": \"what makes this version distinct\"",
  "  },",
  "",
  "Drop the weight file into models/diffusion_models/ (same on workers).",
  "Availability is computed from disk automatically \u2014 if the file is there,",
  "the Video Studio select picks it up on next page load. If the model needs",
  "a different graph, add tool/workflows/<your_template>.json and point",
  "\"workflow\" at it. Delete the entry (or set \"disabled\": true) to remove.",
  "",
  "Optional \"catalog\" block = how the model pickers list the entry:",
  "  \"catalog\": {\"group\": \"ltx25\" | \"h3_1080p\" | \"h3_draft\" | \"wan\" | \"legacy\",",
  "              \"label\": \"short name\", \"detail\": \"resolution / time\", \"rank\": 10,",
  "              \"recommended\": true}",
  "Without it the entry is grouped by family and listed under its display_name."
 ],
